  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">We were honored to sponsor the Partners in <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/the-drake-law-firm-sponsors-court-support-jeffco/\">Recovery breakfast</a> this week, a program that is doing remarkable work right here in our community.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Partners in Recovery supports families through Jefferson County’s problem-solving courts, helping parents overcome barriers to child support, restoring competency for those awaiting trial, and celebrating the hard work of program graduates. Their work, from reunification supplies to graduation ceremonies, reflects exactly the kind of community investment that changes lives.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>At The Drake Law Firm, we believe in second chances and in the people who show up every day to make them possible. Thank you to the Partners in Recovery team and everyone involved in the problem-solving courts, for all you do.</div>\n<div></div>\n"
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>We were honored to sponsor the Partners in Recovery breakfast this week, a program that is doing remarkable work right here in our community. Partners in Recovery supports families through Jefferson County’s problem-solving courts, helping parents overcome barriers to child support, restoring competency for those awaiting trial, and celebrating the hard work of program graduates. [&hellip;]</p>\n"
  },
